  "bodyHash": "dd89b0347ba1f974",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">原版项目很快就会更新，请持续关注<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方页面</a>！ </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">这是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Gun Mod</a>的非官方移植版，<strong>需要安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Framework</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">MrCrayfish's Gun Mod 是一款理念独特、令人兴奋的全新武器模组。添加了九种武器，均可高度自定义，打造属于你自己的独特变体。通过安装配件和附魔，你可以提升武器的各项属性，创造出更加强大的版本。染色剂可用于更改任何武器和配件的颜色。本模组还添加了手榴弹和闪光弹！</span></em></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">移植版所做的修改：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">1. 闪光弹的音效现已改为单声道（参考 <a href=\"https://github.com/MrCrayfish/MrCrayfishGunMod/pull/506\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfishGunMod#506</a>，使用 ffmpeg 生成的新文件）；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">2. 现在你可以将染色后的 CGM 物品浸入装满水的炼药锅中来洗去染料；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">3. 修正了弹壳模型；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">4. 修复了换弹动画中弹药物品的渲染&nbsp;方向；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">5. 额外实现了以下模组的兼容性：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked</a>；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a>；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a>；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-planes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Planes</a>；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">...</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">如果 MrCrayfish 也已更新到该版本，请优先<strong>使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版模组</a></strong>！</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
